    {"1.5", "2026-11-12", [[
|cffe6cc80Character notes|r

• Shared guild notes: turn on |cffffffffShare guild notes|r and your notes go to guildmates with the addon (tick |cffffffffPrivate|r to keep one to yourself). Guild notes show with their author in the notes window, tooltips and the Looking For Group window, count toward group warnings, and are passed along to guildmates who weren't online at the same time.
• |cffffffffClear guild notes|r removes every note you didn't write, for good.

|cffe6cc80Loadouts|r

• Edit a saved loadout: write macros (icon, text with a 255 counter, character or account), insert helpers and spells, or add a ready-made macro (mouseover cast, focus, cast sequence, trinket and cast, stop casting, start attack, pet).
• Edit its bars (drop spells, items and macros on slots, drag to swap, right-click to put a macro or clear), key bindings (click, then press a key) and settings. |cffffffffRevert changes|r undoes your edits.
• Loading saves and restores account macros and macro key bindings too, and refuses a load that has no room for its macros before changing anything.
• Loadouts using new features share as KU2:; plain ones stay KU1: for older versions.

|cffe6cc80Ping macro|r

• Nearby alert is now part of the Ping macro, on its settings page, and off until you tick |cffffffffAlert when nearby|r.

|cffe6cc80Kill stats|r

• Page tabs in WoW Forever's style, under the window.

|cffe6cc80General|r

• Settings that can't open in combat, and macros and bars that change after combat, now all wait for combat to end the same way.]]},
